---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import meta from '../data/page-meta.json';
const m = meta['/thank-you/'];
---
<Base title={m.title} description={m.description}>
  <img class="portrait" src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/mags-sikora-SEO-expert-london.webp" alt="Mags Sikora, SEO expert, London" width="400" height="400" />
  <div class="story">
    <h1>You're Almost There!</h1>
    <p><strong>Please go to your inbox to confirm your email.</strong><br />&amp; get ready for Your SEO Checklist!</p>
    <p>To ensure that you receive my newsletter and gain access to your exclusive SEO Checklist, please take these quick steps:</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Check Your Inbox:</strong> Keep an eye on your inbox for an email from me with the subject “Confirmation email” Click on the confirmation link inside.</li>
      <li><strong>Spam Folder Check:</strong> Occasionally, emails may mistakenly land in the spam or junk folder. If you can’t find my email in your inbox, please check those folders.</li>
      <li><strong>Move Me to Your Primary Tab:</strong> To ensure you never miss any updates, simply drag and drop my email into your primary inbox. This way, you won’t miss any valuable insights.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Once you’ve confirmed your email, you’ll gain full access to my SEO resources and upcoming content.</p>
    <p>I’m eager to start this SEO journey with you. Should you have any questions or need assistance, don’t hesitate to contact me at mags[at]sheknowsdigital.com.</p>
    <p>Thank you for choosing to be a part of our SEO community!</p>
    <p>Warm regards,</p>
    <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Screenshot-2024-01-22-at-13.53.32.png" alt="Mags, xox" style="margin:0 auto;max-width:180px" loading="lazy" />
  </div>
</Base>
